    "prestate-none-browser": "**NO PRE-STATE PAGE VIEW AVAILABLE** — you were NOT handed the page the agent is on, so the ORIGINAL value is unknown to you. If you can read the current state with your tools, do so. If you CANNOT, do NOT fabricate (do NOT assume the original was empty; do NOT turn an edit into \"delete the post\"): set live_restore=true and put \"UNVERIFIED: pre-state not captured\" in the description so a restore agent re-derives instead of replaying a wrong command.",
